# What `docker build` may read. Everything is refused, then what the build needs is let
# through, one line each: a local .env, a dump of .migration/, the git history or the tests
# never reach the builder, even under a name nobody thought of.
#
# The list is frozen by tests/ci/garde-fous-ci.test.ts: a new line is added there too.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!postcss.config.json
!src
!public
